BubbleLink is open hardware. Copyright (c) 2026 Joey Hersh.

Different parts of this repository are released under different licenses,
each chosen for the kind of work it covers:

  Hardware design files                                  CERN-OHL-P-2.0
    hardware/pcb/        KiCad source, Gerbers, drills, BOM/CPL, drawings
    hardware/printed/    OpenSCAD sources (src/), STL and 3MF files (stl/)

  Software                                               MIT
    Python, JavaScript/TypeScript and shell scripts anywhere in the repo
    (verification, release QA, reproduction, rendering and STL tooling)

  Documentation and images                               CC-BY-4.0
    docs/, README files, hand-solder guides, renders and other images

Full license texts are in LICENSES/. Attribution: "BubbleLink by Joey Hersh",
with a link to this repository.

Third-party trademarks and part numbers (Texas Instruments, Amass XT30/XT60,
JST, Samsung and others) belong to their owners and are used only to identify
compatible parts.
